.TH IP-AUDIT-LOOKUP 1 "November 2026" "Kea IP Audit Hook" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ip-audit-lookup \- show the lease history for an IP address at a given time
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ip-audit-lookup
.I IP TIMESTAMP LOGS
[
.I LOGS
...]
[
.B --json
|
.B --table
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ip-audit-lookup
reconstructs lease intervals from Kea IP audit JSON records and reports the lease
matching an IPv4 or IPv6 address at the requested time, followed by its event timeline.
It reads plain JSON Lines files and gzip-compressed files.
.PP
A log base path includes that file and its numbered rotations, including gzip-compressed
rotations (for example,
.BR ip-audit.log.1.gz ).
You may instead supply explicit files or a quoted shell glob pattern. Multiple log
specifications may be supplied.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I IP
IPv4 or IPv6 address to look up.
.TP
.I TIMESTAMP
Query time in ISO 8601 format with a timezone, for example
.BR 2026-11-04T12:00:00Z .
.TP
.I LOGS
One or more log files, base log paths, or quoted glob patterns.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --json
Write a JSON object containing the query, matching lease intervals, and matching events.
Each event includes its source location and original record.
.TP
.B --table
Write tab-separated match and event tables with a header row.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show the help message and exit.
.SH OUTPUT
By default, prints the matching lease interval, if any, and a readable timeline of
matching audit events with source file and line numbers. Intervals include their start
time and exclude their end time. A delegated IPv6 prefix matches addresses contained
in that prefix.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
A lease matches the address at the requested time.
.TP
.B 1
No lease matches the address at the requested time.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid input or an unreadable or malformed log.
.SH LIMITATIONS
Results are inferred from the available audit logs, not queried from Kea's live lease
database. Missing, filtered, dropped, or not-yet-written events can make the timeline
incomplete. Log records should retain the timestamp, event, IP address, lease expiry,
and client identity fields. Full logs are loaded into memory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ip-audit-list (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Kea IP Audit Hook contributors.